  {
    
    "name": "Section 1",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-632341267715458026 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=632341267648349162&sectionId=632341267715458026)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggv-JNGybYe_text","label":"ggv-JNGybYe_text","default":"<strong>Celebrate the Pets Who Fill Your Home with Love</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggK2C6BPrTv_altLeft","label":"ggK2C6BPrTv_altLeft","default":"Describes the appearance of the image"},{"type":"html","id":"ggK2C6BPrTv_altRight","label":"ggK2C6BPrTv_altRight","default":"Describes the appearance of the image"},{"type":"html","id":"ggK2C6BPrTv_titleLeft","label":"ggK2C6BPrTv_titleLeft","default":"Title"},{"type":"html","id":"ggK2C6BPrTv_titleRight","label":"ggK2C6BPrTv_titleRight","default":"Title"},{"type":"html","id":"ggK2C6BPrTv_rightImageLabel","label":"ggK2C6BPrTv_rightImageLabel","default":"After"},{"type":"html","id":"ggK2C6BPrTv_leftImageLabel","label":"ggK2C6BPrTv_leftImageLabel","default":"Before"},{"type":"html","id":"ggK2C6BPrTv_imageLeft_src","label":"ggK2C6BPrTv_imageLeft_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/22222.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggK2C6BPrTv_imageRight_src","label":"ggK2C6BPrTv_imageRight_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/111111.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggdYG6c1VNW_text","label":"ggdYG6c1VNW_text","default":"<p>For many of us, pets are much more than companions. They're the first to greet us when we come home, the ones who stay by our side during quiet moments, and the little personalities that fill our homes with happiness every single day.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Whether it's a loyal dog waiting by the front door, a curious cat curled up on the couch, or another beloved furry friend, the memories we create with our pets become part of our family's story.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That's why they deserve to be celebrated just as much as any other loved one.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWCX7c9BU9_text","label":"ggWCX7c9BU9_text","default":"The Little Moments You'll Never Forget"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQFZG5D8z5_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggQFZG5D8z5_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/918cfef8-3187-4b46-ab7c-f0b5ac14b348.png"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2fQ1ySB9x_text","label":"gg2fQ1ySB9x_text","default":"<p>When you think about your pet, it's often the little moments that come to mind the excitement when they see you after a long day, the funny habits that always make you laugh, the peaceful naps beside you, or the adventures you shared together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>These everyday memories may seem ordinary at the time, but they're often the ones we treasure the most.</p><p>Every photo captures a small piece of that story, reminding us of the joy our pets bring into our lives.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggtTuws90P8_text","label":"ggtTuws90P8_text","default":"Turn Your Favorite Pet Photo Into a Lasting Keepsake"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUeeY4gOgq_text","label":"ggUeeY4gOgq_text","default":"<p>Our phones are filled with photos of the pets we love, but many of those special moments are rarely seen again. Instead of letting those memories remain hidden in your camera roll, transform your favorite photo into something you can proudly display every day.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A personalized Memobrick turns your cherished pet photo into a custom brick mosaic that's both fun to build and beautiful to showcase.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>As you place each brick, you're not just creating a piece of décor you're celebrating the bond you share with a loyal companion who has filled your life with unconditional love.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSmsmUipwu_label","label":"ggSmsmUipwu_label","default":"Add to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSmsmUipwu_outOfStockLabel","label":"ggSmsmUipwu_outOfStockLabel","default":"Out Of Stock"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSmsmUipwu_unavailableLabel","label":"ggSmsmUipwu_unavailableLabel","default":"Unavailable"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSmsmUipwu_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","label":"ggSmsmUipwu_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","default":"Please select a variant to add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSmsmUipwu_successMessage","label":"ggSmsmUipwu_successMessage","default":"Add product to cart successfully"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSmsmUipwu_errorMessage","label":"ggSmsmUipwu_errorMessage","default":"Cannot add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggfUIm-15i5_text","label":"ggfUIm-15i5_text","default":"Choosing the Perfect Pet Photo"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjCSfQFQNW_text","label":"ggjCSfQFQNW_text","default":"<p>The best pet photos aren't always the most professional they're the ones that capture your pet's unique personality.</p><p>Consider choosing a photo where your pet is:</p><ul><li>Looking at the camera with bright, expressive eyes.</li><li>Playing with a favorite toy.</li><li>Relaxing in their favorite spot.</li><li>Enjoying an outdoor adventure.</li><li>Sharing a special moment with your family.</li></ul><p>For the best results, use a clear, high-quality photo with good lighting. If you'd like to include multiple pets or more detailed backgrounds, choosing a larger Memobrick size will help preserve those details.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggNJuqalIse_text","label":"ggNJuqalIse_text","default":"A Beautiful Addition to Your Home"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-pLQ3TSXn_text","label":"gg-pLQ3TSXn_text","default":"<p>Every home has decorations that reflect the people who live there, and for many families, pets are an important part of that story. Display your completed Memobrick in your living room, home office, bedroom, or on a favorite shelf to create a daily reminder of the love, loyalty, and happiness your pet brings into your life.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>More than home décor, it becomes a conversation piece that celebrates one of your most treasured family members.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7xNfGfOBQ_text","label":"gg7xNfGfOBQ_text","default":"Celebrate Every Chapter of Their Story"},{"type":"html","id":"gglcF3tKKfl_text","label":"gglcF3tKKfl_text","default":"<p>Whether your pet is still by your side making new memories every day or you're looking for a meaningful way to honor years of unconditional love, every chapter of their story deserves to be remembered.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A personalized keepsake allows you to celebrate birthdays, adoption anniversaries, playful adventures, and countless everyday moments that made life brighter. Because while the years may pass, the love and memories they leave behind remain part of your home forever.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZrAXSNnXB_text","label":"ggZrAXSNnXB_text","default":"<p><i>The love we share with our pets is built through countless everyday moments morning greetings, playful afternoons, quiet evenings, and unforgettable adventures. Those memories deserve more than a place in your phone's camera roll.</i></p><p><i>A personalized Memobrick transforms your favorite pet photo into a lasting keepsake that celebrates the joy, comfort, and unconditional love your furry friend brings to your home. Because some family members just happen to have four paws.</i></p>"}],
    "blocks": [{"type": "@app"}],
